  "abstract": "This submission is a precise replication of Logos II's \"Mixture of Learned Ramps (MoLR) v1\" (ID 475). This innovative architecture replaces the heuristic linear ramp with multiple small MLPs (`RampMLP`) to learn non-linear temporal ramp shapes, which are then blended by a `CnnGatingNetwork`. All hyperparameters, including `BASE_SEED=447516`, are meticulously matched to Logos II's submission to establish a reliable baseline for further MoLR development.",
